00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:13.320
This beautiful retro bottle.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.377
(slides click)

00:00:14.377 --> 00:00:16.119
It's just better.

00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:16.974
Right?

00:00:16.974 --> 00:00:18.527
Right?

00:00:18.527 --> 00:00:19.360
It's just better.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.647
Actually, the reality is no.

00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:24.620
Something's going on with Mexican Coke

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.223
